<!-- SEO helper text -->
      <div class="rotorem-seo-text">
        <p>When your boiler stops heating, starts leaking, or switches off on its own, home comfort is seriously affected. Our team offers fast and reliable in-home boiler repair, as well as professional installation of new units. We work in Varna and nearby areas, responding quickly and solving the issue during the visit whenever possible.</p>
        <h2>What boiler problems we repair in Varna</h2>
        <p>We repair all common boiler faults, including no hot water, weak heating, and sudden shutdowns. If there is leakage from the flange or safety valve, we react quickly to prevent greater damage. In many cases, the cause is a burned heating element, faulty thermostat, or limescale buildup, requiring cleaning or part replacement.</p>
        <p>We provide repair and installation for different boiler types, including vertical, horizontal, and compact under-sink models.</p>
        <p>Besides boiler repair, you can also rely on us for other home issues. If needed, see our <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/services/electrical-services/">electrical services</a>, <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/services/oven-repair/">oven repair</a>, and other <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/services/">home appliance services</a>.</p>
        <h2>Which boiler brands we repair in Varna</h2>
        <p>We repair Eldom, Ariston, TESY, Diplomat, Bosch, Alpa, and other popular brands. We know their design specifics and typical weaknesses, which allows quick diagnostics and precise repair. Whether the model is older or newer, we use the right parts and the right solution for the specific unit.</p>
        <h2>Areas in Varna we cover</h2>
        <p>We work in all city districts and nearby areas up to about 20 km. We serve Chaika, Levski, Vladislav Varnenchik, Mladost, Asparuhovo, Galata, and central Varna. On request, we send a technician to your address so you avoid removal and transport of the appliance.</p>
        <h2>How the repair process works</h2>
        <p>The process starts with on-site diagnostics to identify the exact issue. Then we provide a clear quote for repair or installation. After approval, we proceed with the repair or install the new unit.</p>
        <p>After completion, we test the system to make sure everything works correctly. During installation and removal, we follow room specifics and safety requirements. We leave the work area clean and provide guidance for proper use.</p>
        <h2>Why choose RotoRem</h2>
        <p>Clients contact us when they want a fast solution without complications. We work at your address, saving time and transport. We have practical experience with all major brands and with different installation and removal cases. We provide clear terms, service warranty, and professional attitude in every case. <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/contact/">Contact us</a> now and book a convenient visit.</p>
